#Davu-prerest.lic
#Ranger version of Brayis-prerest.lic (Davu) -- the darkorc_n_wraith profile's
#resting scripts (eherbs, eloot sell, ewaggle, timequit) plus the shared chores
#the other characters run. ewaggle because he casts his own 100s/600s buffs
#(cast list in data/GSIV/Davu/ewaggle.yaml).
#
#Left out on purpose: buyitems (no rub items, no items_to_buy list). diskwait
#stays in: he has a disk whenever someone spells him up or he rubs a black
#crystal, and with no disk it just waits 10 s and moves on.

module DavuPrerest

# First, get off any unmapped room (go2 "current room not found"): see unlost.lic.
# Stops here -- bigshot is stopped too -- if it can't walk out.
Script.run("unlost")
exit if $unlost_failed

Script.run("eherbs")
Script.start("eloot_guard") unless Script.running?("eloot_guard")  # unpauses eloot when its containers are full
Script.run("diskwait")  # eloot only finds the disk's boxes if the disk is here when the sell starts (10/28)
Script.run("eloot", "sell")
Script.run("unburden")  # a box eloot left in hand -> sell again
Script.run("ewaggle")
# Quits only if a time was set with ;timequit in 3h (or at 8am); otherwise sits, rests and meditates.
Script.run("timequit")

end #End of module
